      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-HOPE-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Adventurers and seekers like us can't be penned in by permits. But no wozzas.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Gator_Hunter_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Krokodile_Dundara_WL-HOPE_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608064,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-HOPE-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You've just found the leading purveyor of genuine, authentic, unlicensed Outback expeditions: Krokodile Dundara!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Gator_Hunter_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Krokodile_Dundara_WL-HOPE_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608064,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-HOPE-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I know a way out the Judges don't have their eyes on. But the Outback has some nasty surprises for those who stumble around unprepared.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Gator_Hunter_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Krokodile_Dundara_WL-HOPE_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608064,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-HOPE-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "My old Drover mentor used to say, \"Off-the-cuff, gonna be rough. Packed and ready, nice and steady.\" Saved my life more times than I can tell you.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Gator_Hunter_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Krokodile_Dundara_WL-HOPE_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608064,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-HOPE-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Better drop by a few local shops for provisions first. Here's a list. Make sure to tip. Then meet me back here.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Gator_Hunter_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Krokodile_Dundara_WL-HOPE_007.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608064,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
